OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to reopen after ceiling
OL,4,Acollapse checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel forced to close while repairs
OL,7,Fto the building were made following the
OL,8,Fdiscovery of structural damage is set
OL,9,Fto reopen.
OL,11,FGuests and staff had to leave The Bear
OL,12,FHotel in Wareham on Sunday 11 October
OL,13,Fafter part of a ceiling and masonry
OL,14,Fabove a bay window in a second-floor
OL,15,Fbedroom came down leading to fears of
OL,16,Ffurther collapse.
OL,18,FSouth Street and the pavement opposite
OL,19,Fthe hotel was initially fully closed to
OL,20,Ftraffic while scaffolding and barriers
OL,21,Fwere put up - the road partially
OL,22,Freopened mid week.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
