OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to reopen after ceiling
OL,4,Acollapse checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from the Bear said the
OL,7,Fbuilding had received official
OL,8,Fcertification confirming it had passed
OL,9,Fall inspections and was deemed safe to
OL,10,Freopen and planned to welcome guests
OL,11,Fback on Thursday.
